exercises.body:
Feel into each phase in turn:

external breathing, air moving in and out of the lungs;

transfer, oxygen into the bloodstream;

transport, the blood carrying it to every cell;

absorption, each cell taking it in;

life, each cell burning oxygen into the glow of aliveness.

Then reverse the imagery. Feel life activating the breath — the universal pulse breathing you. Listen to the impulse to breathe.
